-**Hooks and API clients affected**: `useGame.ts` (both `useGame` and `useNightScript`), `useGameSetup.ts` (navigate-to-game flow), `api/games.ts` (game CRUD — may be gutted or wrapped), `api/roles.ts` (`previewScript` method only).
